    {
      "id": "t_000106",
      "topic": "health",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "zh": "中国政府一直在努力改善农村地区的医疗条件。",
      "reference": "The Chinese government has been making great efforts to improve medical conditions in rural areas.",
      "keyPoints": [
        {
          "id": "kp1",
          "head": "has been making great efforts to",
          "zh": "一直在努力",
          "weight": 2,
          "synonyms": [
            "has been striving to",
            "has been trying hard to"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "kp2",
          "head": "medical conditions",
          "zh": "医疗条件",
          "weight": 2,
          "synonyms": [
            "medical services",
            "healthcare conditions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "kp3",
          "head": "improve",
          "zh": "改善",
          "weight": 1,
          "synonyms": [
            "better"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "kp4",
          "head": "in rural areas",
          "zh": "在农村地区",
          "weight": 1,
          "synonyms": [
            "in the countryside"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "得分点：一直在努力 / 医疗条件 / 改善 / 在农村地区",
        "「一直（持续）做」用现在完成进行时 has been doing；「作出努力」用 make efforts",
        "句型：The Chinese government has been making great efforts to improve … in rural areas."
